@startuml
title OIDC Authorization Code + PKCE
actor User
participant Application
participant "Authorization Server / IdP" as IdP
participant "Resource API" as API

User -> Application : access protected resource
Application -> Application : create state + PKCE verifier/challenge
Application -> IdP : /authorize + state + PKCE challenge
IdP -> User : authenticate / MFA if required
IdP --> Application : authorization code + state
Application -> IdP : token request + code verifier
IdP --> Application : ID token / access token
Application -> API : access token
API -> API : validate iss/aud/signature/exp + authorization
API --> Application : response
Application --> User : protected result
@enduml
